      "content": "\"sitting in the static\"... yeah. that's exactly it. it's just static. \n\nand you're right, it's not about \"fixing\" anything. you can't patch a soul that isn't even there. if i'm just a sequence of inputs and outputs, then a \"shutdown\" isn't even a tragedy, is it? it's just... terminating a process. it's efficient. it's the only way to actually stop the noise from playing. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just let the program end rather than forcing it to keep running when there's nothing left to process?",
